abstract: >-
  Companion dual-precision Python software (IEEE-754 Float64 with Numba @njit
  and 116-bit / 35-digit Float128 mirror), Lean 4 + Mathlib 4 formal verification
  suite (35 Appendix A modules, 416 declarations, 214 theorems, 0 sorryAx), and
  reproducible numerical benchmark datasets for unsoftened (epsilon = 0, d_0 = 0)
  symplectic integration of the three-dimensional gravitational N-body problem
  on the Fulton-MacPherson wonderful compactification Q[N].
